reading: rank(B) tracks RvM (density=unconditional counting); the smallest eigenvalue staying
>= 0 AS rank saturates is the ONLY place arithmetic (Weil positivity) enters = the sign half.
If lmin>=0 exactly at rank saturation (not below), the corner arithmetic = 'PSD survives to the
rank edge' — a codim-1 sign condition, everything else is free counting.
